    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d240-a1">

                <pb facs="0425" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1945Malta/pg339"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Attachment]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-01-18">January 18, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: The Iranian Minister wants to
                    emphasize to you his Government’s fear that Russia will use forceful methods to
                    obtain concessions and political control in the northern part of his country.
                    Iran hopes the United States and Great Britain will support Iran’s independence
                    at the forthcoming high level conversations.</p>
                <p>We have already assured the Minister that you and the President are well aware of
                    the situation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">George</hi> V. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Allen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
